Replacement ruling for the agent

CORRECTION: Zixxtrixx has one artist-authored model. Do not build or art-direct separate LOD models. compile_creature derives the micro representation and its measured error from that one source; GEOM.LOD/GEOM.MESHFETCH chooses mesh, micro, splat or glint per camera in hardware.

Also stop treating the existing 220-key salto as the production attack system. Preserve it as the golden Ground Dive preset, but build a programmable choreography layer. Shared clips own local body shape—compress, release, coil, unroll, spear, recoil, recover. A per-instance full-3D root transform owns trajectory, spin count, spin plane and attack direction. The simulation creates an AttackPlan from the target and branches on actual collision.

A ground target may receive the current three-flip downward-forward burial. A high flying target may receive a higher jump, more flips and an upward or forward spear. A low or distant target may receive fewer flips and a long horizontal shot. The body phases remain shared and cacheable; only the root choreography varies.

Give the spring compression real time: settle, 0.4–0.6 seconds of whole-S compression, a readable hold, then a tail-to-head release that visibly causes the launch. Move whole-body flips out of bone 0 and into the programmable root orientation. Never again bind actual impact to one fixed clip key.
